0001   0000             ; Compact native MC6803 chess for a stock 4K MC-10.
0002   0000             ; Inspired by Peter Jennings' MicroChess and the supplied 6502 source.
0003   0000             ; Native 0x88 board / legal moves / negamax with Jennings-derived features.
0004   0000             ; Original piece values, queen-weighted mobility, capture counts and bonus.
0005   0000             ; Not a translation of the original JANUS/TREE/STRATGY state machine.
0006   0000             ; MicroChess (c) 1996-2002 Peter Jennings, peterj@benlo.com
0007   0000             ; Telemark: tasm -68 -x3 -b -g3 microchess-4k.asm microchess-4k.bin
0008   0000             ; CLEAR 0,17407 : CLOADM : EXEC 17408. Stock MICROCOLOR BASIC ROM.
0009   0000             ; Piece codes: P=1 N=2 B=3 R=4 Q=5 K=6; black adds 8.
0010   0000             ; FRAME offsets: type=0 from=1 to=2 piece=3 captured=4 dir=5 limit=6,
0011   0000             ; table=7..8 best=9 found=10 depth=11 bonus=12 bestfrom=13 bestto=14.
